            "description": "Mark a task done.\n\n`completed` is optional and defaults to `true`, so an empty body marks the task done. Send `{\"completed\": false}` to reopen it.\n\nWrites an entry to the project activity feed and broadcasts `TaskUpdated` for `completed_at`."
          },
